# AI Presentation & Prompt Engineering Project

## 📌 Project Overview

This project explores how AI can be used to transform structured data and requirements into a clear, presentation-ready output.

The project focuses on prompt design, data interpretation, AI output evaluation, and human review.

## 🎯 Objective

The main objective of this project is to understand how effective prompting and structured instructions can improve AI-generated outputs.

It also focuses on checking whether AI-generated results are consistent with the given data and requirements.

## 📊 Dataset

The project uses the NovaFlow dataset to analyze changes in:

- Users
- Revenue
- Retention
- Support time
- Crash rate
- AI adoption

## 🔍 Data Analysis

The dataset was examined to identify changes, trends, and possible inconsistencies.

The analysis was used as a basis for creating the presentation rather than relying only on AI-generated explanations.

## 🤖 Prompt Engineering

Prompts were structured to guide the AI toward:

- Understanding the given data
- Identifying important changes
- Organizing information
- Generating presentation-ready content
- Following specific requirements

## 🧪 AI Output Evaluation

AI-generated output was reviewed instead of being accepted directly.

The evaluation focused on:

- Data accuracy
- Logical consistency
- Relevance
- Missing information
- Unnecessary claims
- Alignment with the original requirements

## 🔄 Workflow

**Requirement → Data → Prompt → AI Output → Human Review → Validation → Final Output**

